&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Manager I for Threat Detection - Applied AI, you will lead the strategy, roadmap, and execution of Datadog Security’s applied AI investments in detection engineering and security incident response. You will build and grow a team dedicated to engineering AI systems for Datadog&#39;s unique detection and response needs. By integrating these solutions with our current platform, your team will drive the use of applied AI to optimize and speed up security operations. Some examples include detection-authoring agents, model-driven coverage analysis, autonomous threat hunting, alert triage and the evaluation infrastructure that holds these systems to a high bar of fidelity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Detection authorship is a shared responsibility across the organization, and your team contributes both by building the AI systems that author and tune detections and by writing detections directly when their domain expertise is the right tool.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
